  "content": "<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdathost.net%252fr%252fbareneil%252fminecraft-server-hosting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1475587/description_7bacedcb-1d61-4bd0-8d04-cb8a0b267406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"81\"></a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為《進食動畫》與《農夫樂事》模組的食物，以及其他《農夫樂事》附加主題模組的變體增添相容性</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>材質包相容包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫更多模組相容性</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1389349/description_498e94e6-16e0-4290-8c0c-03348a5b5ca8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"141\"></em></a></p><p><strong>為以下模組增添相容性：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫（Fabric）</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫（Forge）</a></strong></p><h3><strong>模組相容列表：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">天域樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fartifacts-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺物樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>混沌樂事（來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/compat-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Delight</a>）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事 [Forge]</a></strong><strong>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineral-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>礦物樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄樂事</a></strong><strong>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Fabric]</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oceans-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">海洋樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色風味樂事</a></strong>&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">（與<strong>進食動畫+</strong>搭配使用）</a></em></li>\n</ul><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3f0a1c89-cb57-47ab-9875-aa6dd5c91527.png\"></strong></p><div>\n<div style=\"width:300px;font-size:13px\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
